# Copy to .env and fill in. The PUBLIC_ prefix exposes this to the browser,
# which is required (and safe) for Web3Forms — its access keys are designed to
# be client-side and only authorise sending to the inbox they were issued for.
#
# Get a free key in seconds at https://web3forms.com — enter the inbox that
# should receive enquiries (e.g. hello@os.partners). Until this is set, the
# booker form renders but submission fails over to the mailto: fallback.
PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
